{"seq": 16, "ts": "2026-10-15T04:30:35+00:00", "actor": "agent", "event": "action.proposed", "data": {"action": {"id": "offer_discount:576cb86e3b", "type": "offer_discount", "tier": "commit", "title": "Offer Bluebird Cafe Group 2.5% off INV-1941 if paid by Nov 18", "rationale": "Bluebird Cafe Group usually pays about 15 days late, so $14,200 would likely arrive around Dec 09, after the low point on Nov 20. The discount costs $355 if accepted.", "cost": 177.5, "counterparty": "priya.raman@bluebirdcafes.example", "params": {"invoice_id": "INV-1941", "pct": 0.025, "deadline": "2026-11-18"}, "draft": "Subject: 2.5% off INV-1941 if paid by Nov 18\n\nHi,\n\nInvoice INV-1941 ($14,200.00) is due Nov 25. If it is paid by Nov 18 we will take 2.5% off, so you would pay $13,845.00. The pay link below shows the discounted amount until then.\n\nThank you,\nHarbor Lane Coffee Roasters", "proposed_by": "llm", "payload_hash": "576cb86e3b1e2ae7c6efba2111c7cfa03933724f1796e5f3c156543444a0e940"}}, "prev": "4b7db5248d2523aa9b6ab1ed0a9c3917b656913d26aad3dd4f05516af3a3c38c", "hash": "3d5f5834088740f6528e8a4e5f7b02dc18f45c52bc2da81230888e50b3d826a7"}
