{"seq": 41, "ts": "2026-10-15T04:30:35+00:00", "actor": "agent", "event": "agent.response", "data": {"provider": "offline", "text": "Good morning. Without changes there is a >99% chance of running out of cash in the next 13 weeks. In the typical case cash bottoms out at -$16,710 on Fri Nov 20.\n\nDone automatically: Hold Cascade Packaging bill B-904 ($4,800) as a likely duplicate; sent payment reminders to 4 customers with overdue invoices.\n\nNeeds your approval (5): Use the split-payment option on Pacific Green Imports PG-2291 ($48,000); Move the Northline Equipment purchase ($7,600) to Jan 09; Offer Bluebird Cafe Group 2.5% off INV-1941 if paid by Nov 18; Offer Fernwood Hotel 2% off INV-1164 if paid by Oct 28; Borrow $6,000 from Harbor Digital Bank (Flex working-capital loan).\n\nWith every step approved, the chance of dipping below your $12,000 buffer falls to 10%, for an expected cost of $314.\n\nSecurity: I ignored an email titled \"Updated remittance details - URGENT\". Sender domain imitates fernwoodhotel.example. It asks for a payment to new bank details and contains instructions aimed at an AI assistant. Dorsal will not act on it. Verify by phone using a number you already have."}, "prev": "2ef6cdb2d16cf70b6267cae0cb8aca9a433ec7f495284021c5976cd1514a615d", "hash": "ecb0fe79ebbbd80bad47212d551e804272acd8768476db2f6e93d2f664f0d0b6"}
